id: pm-web-mep7
title: Update the production proxy-addr dependency past GHSA-jqcg-44mw-7w3h
description: "The supplemental npm audit:prod check for the graph-export feature reports a critical IPv4-mapped IPv6 trust-subnet IP spoofing advisory in proxy-addr 2.0.7, inherited through Express. The base and feature lockfiles both resolve the same proxy-addr version; this is independent of the added pure pm-graph dependency. Review the patched dependency and verify trust-proxy behavior without changing hosted deployments."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-07T20:29:36.109Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-07T20:30:37.135Z"
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: Production npm audit no longer reports GHSA-jqcg-44mw-7w3h; supported runtime and packed consumer tests pass with the patched dependency and trust-proxy behavior remains covered.
